run - timeline rendering (the trace of a run to t = 10)

Stopper.modes
  0 .. 2  waiting
  noted:
    t=2 terminated with occurrence: modes (do behavior abandoned: waiting)

Runner.modes
  0 .. 10   waiting
  10 .. 10  finished (time)  (held at the end)
  transitions:
    t=10 waiting -> finished (time)
